<div class="recent-projects" aria-labelledby="recent-projects-heading">
  <h3 id="recent-projects-heading" class="recent-projects-heading" data-i18n="recent.heading">New work · 2026</h3>
  <div class="recent-projects-grid">
    <article data-project-kind="source" class="recent-project recent-project-opus" aria-labelledby="recent-project-opus-title">
      <div class="recent-project-top">
        <div class="recent-project-symbol"><img src="assets/opus-mark.svg" alt="" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div>
          <p class="recent-project-status" data-i18n="recent.opus.status">Completed · CESAE Digital · November 2026</p>
          <h4 id="recent-project-opus-title">OPUS</h4>
          <p class="recent-project-subtitle" data-i18n="recent.opus.subtitle">Classical Music Library</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p data-i18n="recent.opus.description">A Laravel and MySQL catalogue of composers and works, with searches, filters, favourites, role-based permissions, PDF scores and selective Open Opus API imports.</p>
      <p class="recent-project-note" data-i18n="recent.opus.note">The project overview and source code are public; the interactive Laravel application is not yet deployed.</p>
      <div class="recent-project-tags" aria-label="Technologies"><span>PHP</span><span>Laravel</span><span>MySQL</span><span>Blade</span></div>
      <div class="recent-project-links">
        <a class="btn btn-light" href="projects/opus/" data-i18n="recent.opus.caseStudy">View project</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/danielatorresalmeida/opus-laravel" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="recent.source">Source code</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article data-project-kind="published" class="recent-project recent-project-tasks" aria-labelledby="recent-project-tasks-title">
      <div class="recent-project-top">
        <div class="recent-project-js" aria-hidden="true">JS</div>
        <div>
          <p class="recent-project-status" data-i18n="recent.tasks.status">Published · CESAE Digital · November 2026</p>
          <h4 id="recent-project-tasks-title" data-i18n="recent.tasks.title">Intelligent Task Manager</h4>
          <p class="recent-project-subtitle" data-i18n="recent.tasks.subtitle">Interactive JavaScript web app</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p data-i18n="recent.tasks.description">A browser-based task manager with deadlines, status filters, browser storage, light/dark themes and weather data from the Open-Meteo API.</p>
      <p class="recent-project-note" data-i18n="recent.tasks.note">The demo is live. Sign-in is simulated, and tasks are saved only in the user's browser.</p>
      <div class="recent-project-tags" aria-label="Technologies"><span>JavaScript</span><span>HTML</span><span>CSS</span><span>Open-Meteo</span></div>
      <div class="recent-project-links">
        <a class="btn btn-light" href="https://danielatorresalmeida.github.io/gestor-tarefas-inteligente/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="recent.tasks.live">Open live demo</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/danielatorresalmeida/gestor-tarefas-inteligente" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="recent.source">Source code</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>
